            This song, written by Waylon, was originally on his 'I've Always Been Crazy'
album, which hasn't been issued on CD as of 30/10/00, when I did this.
Hopefully, Buddha Records will put it on CD. This song, as far as I know, isn't
currently in-print; not even on compilations. That's a shame, because it's a
cool song :)

Enjoy!

